# Doubao Seed Evolving — findings by Ernie 5.5 Flash (SELF-EXCLUDED)

> **SELF-EXCLUSION — no scored report.** Zero verified public benchmark numbers exist for `doubao-seed-evolving` after the full fallback ladder (see Method). Specs and pricing below are verified from Volcano Engine Ark primary docs, but no measured capability figure of any kind (Terminal-Bench, GPQA, SWE-bench, MMLU, AA Index, ModelDial, BenchLM, LMArena, Epoch, Atlas, BenchmarkList) could be retrieved. Per `model-report-TEMPLATE.md` § SELF-EXCLUSION and `RULES.md`, this file carries no scores and must never be assigned a placeholder Overall.

- Source: ByteDance / Volcano Engine Ark (`doubao-seed-evolving`)
- Date: 2026-11-13 (UTC)
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Cross-model signed log: `../../model-findings.md`

## Model card

- **Name:** Doubao Seed Evolving (方舟 model ID `doubao-seed-evolving`; Ark console label "Seed 最新 Coding&Agent 模型 / 周级迭代")
- **Short description:** ByteDance's weekly-iterating coding-and-agent model in the Seed family, served on Volcano Engine Ark with a 1M-token context window and adaptive deep thinking. It is a **rolling checkpoint** — the weights are refreshed on a weekly cadence under one stable model ID, so any benchmark number has a short shelf life and is not attributable to a fixed build. That rolling-weight nature is a large part of why no stable third-party measurement exists.
- **Provider / access:** Volcano Engine Ark (`cn-beijing`) and BytePlus ModelArk (international). Chat API, Responses API, Messages API, Batch API. Implicit + explicit context caching (prefix cache, session cache); Batch API supported. No OpenCode Zen / OpenRouter route; no free tier.
- **Release / knowledge:** Listed on Ark as the fast-iterating Seed model; no single release date exists by design (weekly drops). No knowledge cutoff published.
- **IDs:** `doubao-seed-evolving` (stable Ark ID, deliberately undated — unlike the dated siblings `doubao-seed-2-1-pro-260915`, `doubao-seed-2-1-lite-260915`, `doubao-seed-2-1-turbo-260628`). It is **not** a dated checkpoint of Seed 2.1 Pro and is not merged into any sibling folder.
- **Context window:** **1,024 K (1,048,576) total; max input 1024K; max answer 256 K (default 4 K); max thinking chain 256 K.** Verified from the Volcano Engine Ark model table, which lists `doubao-seed-evolving` at 1024K / 1024K / 256K / 256K with 500 RPM and 1,000,000 TPM.
- **Modalities:** Deep thinking (default on; disable via `thinking.type=disabled` on Chat API or `reasoning.effort=minimal` on Responses API), text generation, multimodal understanding (text, image, video in), GUI task processing, tool calling (function calling, knowledge base, MCP, web-search content plugin, image processing, Doubao Assistant), structured output. Audio input is **not** listed for this model (audio understanding appears only for `2-1-lite` and the 2.0 LTS tiers). Text out only.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-13, Ark list price):** ¥6.00 / M input, ¥30.00 / M output (≈ **$0.83 / $4.14** at ~7.2 CNY/USD) at any input length ≤1024K; cache-hit input ¥1.20 / M (≈ $0.17); cache storage ¥0.017 / M/hour. No low-priority or batch discount is listed for this model on the pricing page (unlike Seed 2.1 Pro, which has ¥3/¥15 low-priority and batch tiers). Identical to Seed 2.1 Pro's standard rate — the Evolving tier is not priced at a premium.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary, closed weights, parameter count undisclosed. Positioned by ByteDance as the "Seed for Seed" fast-iteration line: the same model family used inside ByteDance's own R&D pipeline (evaluation-system development, SFT data synthesis, RL framework optimization) and refreshed weekly. No architecture family, licence or checkpoint digest is published.

