### Normalized scores (1–100)

**Intentionally omitted — self-excluded.** Zero verified public benchmark numbers were found for this exact model ID, so every score line would be a fabrication. Verified facts are limited to spec-sheet data (context window, modalities, rate limits, pricing) which the methodology does not convert into capability dimensions. No placeholder, proxy or sibling-derived score is entered here: per `RULES.md`, one invented number drags the mean for every reader, and Seed 2.1 Pro's measurements belong to a different (dated) model.

To score this folder later, the minimum evidence needed is: any one of Terminal-Bench 4.x, SWE-bench Verified, GPQA Diamond, AA Intelligence Index, or a ModelDial/LMArena row measured against the `doubao-seed-evolving` ID — plus the measurement date, since the weights move weekly.

